msgid "Script to start remote application"
msgstr "Script para iniciar o programa remoto"

#. i18n: file: cppdebugger/debuggerconfigwidget.ui:293
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KUrlRequester, kcfg_runShellScript)
#: rc.cpp:171
msgid ""
"This shell script is run after the Config gdb script has been sourced by "
"gdb.\n"
"When debugging remotely this script is intended to actually start the remote "
"process.\n"
"[It is expected that the debug executable can be reached on the target, "
"maybe by downloading it as a final build step]\n"
"1) Find a way to execute a command remotely - rsh, ssh, telnet, ...\n"
"2a) Execute \"gdbserver ... application\" on target.\n"
"or if your executable contains the gdb stub\n"
"2b) Execute \"application\" on target."
msgstr ""
"Este script de shell é executado tras que gdb orixine o script de "
"configuración de gdb.\n"
"Cando se depura de xeito remoto este script serve para iniciar o proceso "
"remoto.\n"
"[Agárdase que o executábel depurador poda ser acedido no obxectivo, "
"posibelmente obténdoo como etapa final da construción]\n"
"1) Atope un xeito de executar un comando remotamente - rsh, ssh, "
"telnet, ...\n"
"2a) Execute \"gdbserver ... programa\" no obxectivo.\n"
"ou se o seu executábel contén a matriz de gdb.\n"
"2b) Execute \"programa\" no obxectivo."

